# Bazelisk configuration
#
# Documentation: https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazelisk/blob/master/README.md#bazeliskrc-configuration-file
#
# This file configures where Bazelisk downloads Bazel itself from.

# Use GitHub mirror for Bazel bootstrap to work around bazel.build outages
#BAZELISK_BASE_URL=https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/releases/download

# --- BEGIN user-managed ---
# Project-specific Bazelisk settings — preserved across re-bootstrap. Typical
# entries fetch Bazel through a caching proxy (credentials from ~/.netrc), e.g.:
#   BAZELISK_BASE_URL=https://invalid.invalid/artifactory/github/bazelbuild/bazel/releases/download
# --- END user-managed ---
